The Easiest Way to Run Faster...

Success in the sprints and jumps requires technical mastery of a lot of
different movements and patterns of movement.

But you can make your athletes faster immediately, simply by focusing on =
using
the arms in a specific way.

Check out this video of legendary Coach Tom Tellez teaching proper arm ac=
tion:

http://completetrackandfield.com/arm-action/

Alright, alright. I'll admit it. Over the years, I've gotten lazy with te=
aching
proper arm action.

I know it's important. But...I don't know. It's boring to teach and watch=
. So,
over time, I've distracted myself with the myriad of other skills that ne=
ed to
be taught.

But then I saw this video. And I tried it out. It had such an immediate i=
mpact
on my kids' speed, I'll never get away from it again.

I think teaching and constantly reinforcing this is crucial to the succes=
s of
your sprinters. I know my kids like it and can feel the difference. Yours=
 will
too:

http://completetrackandfield.com/arm-action/


To your success,

Coach Thomas
Track & Field Association

